{"body":"For completeness, it’s worth noting that [Pkarr](https://app.pkarr.org/), which [Iroh uses for signed DNS based discovery](https://docs.iroh.computer/concepts/discovery#endpoint-announces-via-pkarr), has a [simple URI scheme](https://github.com/pubky/pkarr/blob/main/design/base.md) that uses z-base32. However, It’s not widely adopted, and the z-base32 is not an IETF standard. ","replyTo":"b93d542a08d37bd80ad787550af998724b527f3c","type":"comment"}